[node name="Label16" type="Label" parent="GuidePanel/MarginContainer/Control/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer/Insanity" unique_id=517854181]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 32
text = "The current insanity is indicated by the vertical bar in the bottom left.

With higher insanity enemies become stronger, events like portal spawns are
more likely to activate.

At the highest level special currency can drop form Chests.

When the instanity bar is full a temporary buff can be activated, draining all insanity.
The buff gives higher damage, higher speed and health regeneration."

[node name="Chests" type="VBoxContainer" parent="GuidePanel/MarginContainer/Control/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1051616563]
layout_mode = 2

[node name="Label15" type="Label" parent="GuidePanel/MarginContainer/Control/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer/Chests" unique_id=2015638463]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 50
text = "Chests"

[node name="Label16" type="Label" parent="GuidePanel/MarginContainer/Control/ScrollContainer/VBoxContainer/Chests" unique_id=1957856837]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 32
text = "Chest can drop Items like Health Potions, Ammunition, Pages.

At high insanity Level they can also drop special currency,
which can be used for upgrades at an Upgrade Bench."

